&lt;p&gt;A manual SEO audit takes hours and an agency audit costs thousands. &lt;a href="https://github.com/AgriciDaniel/claude-seo" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Claude SEO&lt;/a&gt; is a free plugin for Claude Code that audits any site in roughly 10 to 15 minutes and hands back a prioritized action plan. Here is the route from the README, with the real commands. The short version lives on the &lt;a href="https://dedupedai.com/use-cases/agricidaniel-claude-seo/run-a-full-seo-audit-with-claude-code/?utm_source=devto&amp;amp;utm_medium=article&amp;amp;utm_campaign=howto_claudeseo" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Deduped use-case page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


What it checks
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The plugin is built from 26 sub-skills and 19 specialist agents, and up to 17 of them work on your site at the same time. It covers:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical SEO: crawlability, indexing, sitemaps, robots.txt, redirects, page speed and Core Web Vitals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content quality: E-E-A-T, thin pages and topic coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured data: finds, validates and writes Schema.org markup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI search (GEO): how likely Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Perplexity and Gemini are to cite your pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local and e-commerce SEO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Every recommendation explains why it matters and how you will know it worked.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Install it
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Inside Claude Code, register the marketplace and install the plugin:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;/plugin marketplace add AgriciDaniel/claude-seo
/plugin install claude-seo@agricidaniel-claude-seo
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;h2&gt;


Set it up
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run setup once. It creates its own Python environment and a headless browser:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;/seo setup
/seo doctor
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;/seo doctor&lt;/code&gt; checks readiness, so fix anything it flags before the first audit.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Run the audit
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Type &lt;code&gt;/seo&lt;/code&gt; to list every command. For a full website audit with parallel agents, give it your URL:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;/seo audit https://your-site.example
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;For a single page use &lt;code&gt;/seo page&lt;/code&gt; with the URL. Focused commands exist too, for example &lt;code&gt;/seo technical&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/seo content&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/seo schema&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/seo sitemap&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/seo geo&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/seo local&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


What you get back
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reports come out as Markdown, PDF and JSON, with a prioritized action plan. Work through it from the most important item down, and re-run the specific command after each fix to confirm it moved.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


A prompt you can paste
&lt;/h2&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Install Claude SEO from AgriciDaniel/claude-seo, run /seo setup and /seo doctor, then run /seo audit on &amp;lt;my site url&amp;gt;. Give me the top five fixes ranked by impact and how I will know each one worked.
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;h2&gt;


Who it suits
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A founder or freelancer who wants a scored audit and a to-do list without audit software, or a consultant who wants real numbers on the first call.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


The catch
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It runs on your Claude Code plan, so a full audit with many agents uses part of your usage allowance. Start with &lt;code&gt;/seo page&lt;/code&gt; on your most important URL if you are on a tight plan.&lt;/p&gt;

