&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Miedo&lt;/em&gt; (fear) + &lt;em&gt;cuentista&lt;/em&gt; (storyteller): the fear-teller. Built for the &lt;strong&gt;Hacktoberfest Open-Source AI Challenge, Week 4: Ghost in the Machine&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everything runs on your own computer through &lt;a href="https://ollama.com" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;Ollama&lt;/a&gt;. No cloud, no API key, no cost, and your images never leave your machine.&lt;/p&gt;
